B.awj=new A.jV("For reading in the app, the text has been converted to plain paragraphs; endnotes and some typographic details were left out.",null)
B.awk=new A.jV("Standard Ebooks dedicates its editions (their formatting, proofreading and cover designs) to the public domain under the Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication (creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The underlying texts are believed to be in the public domain in the United States; copyright status may differ in other countries. Liber et Libri is not affiliated with or endorsed by Standard Ebooks.",null)
